# The repository stores text with LF endings and checks it out native.
#
# This is built on Windows and will be cloned by reviewers on macOS and Linux, and the deploy
# criterion is that a stranger runs it within thirty minutes. Committed CRLF is how that stranger
# gets a shell script with carriage returns in it, or a diff that is entirely line endings.
* text=auto

# Binary and generated, never touched
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.db binary

# Generated with provenance; keep the diff readable
data/rubric.json text eol=lf
